# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]

# marimo session caches (regenerated on every notebook run)
__marimo__/

# Python packaging artifacts. Anchored with a leading slash so they match only at the
# repo root: unanchored, `build/` also matched the `football/build/` package (ADR 0031)
# and silently excluded files added to it — `git add` says nothing about an ignored
# path, and a missing __init__.py still imports as a namespace package, so the loss
# would surface only as a broken clone.
/build/
/dist/
/wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# Secrets
.env

# Data cache and derived DB (regenerable via collect.py / parse.py).
#
# One deliberate exception: data/commentary.db is NOT regenerable. It is the
# system of record for ESPN Commentary Lines, whose inferred Categories are
# assigned by a language model — they cost money to produce and re-running the
# classifier will not reproduce them exactly. It is ignored anyway, with no
# backup, as an accepted risk: losing data/ loses those labels for good. Every
# other store here can be rebuilt from the raw cache; this one cannot.
data/

# Refresh runtime state (ADR 0018): run-history DB, ledger, and per-run logs.
# The refresh/ code and README.md are tracked; only its local state is ignored.
refresh/refresh.db
refresh/refresh_ledger.json
refresh/logs/

# Live Mirror runtime state (ADR 0020): the provisional in-play DB is regenerable
# by re-polling. The live/ code is tracked; only its local DB is ignored.
live/live.db

# Operator dashboard runtime logs (ADR 0021): per-trigger subprocess logs.
# The football/ui/ code is tracked; only the captured job logs are ignored.
console/logs/

# Viewer serving store + runtime (ADR 0023): serve.db is a re-derivable daily slice
# of football.db (rebuild via `python -m web.publish`); logs are live-poll subprocess
# output. The web/ code and templates are tracked; only local state is ignored.
web/serve.db
web/serve.db.tmp
web/logs/

# Venue registry write lock (ADR 0028) — transient; the registry itself
# (football/registry/venues.json) is committed. Path moved by ADR 0031.
football/registry/venues.json.lock

# Harness-written transient settings temp files
.claude/*.tmp.*
